OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,FWords by ITV News Producer Jennifer
OL,7,FMawby
OL,9,FThe UK has seen a prolonged period of
OL,10,Fhot weather and dry conditions, with
OL,11,Ftemperatures reaching 35C on Wednesday.
OL,13,FHalf of England is officially in a
OL,14,F'flash drought' due to lack of rain
OL,15,Fand hot temperatures, conditions which
OL,16,Fare set to continue for parts of the
OL,17,FUK this week.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
