OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,FAmber heat health alerts have been
OL,7,Fissued by the UK Health Security
OL,8,FAgency (UKHSA) for East Midlands, East
OL,9,Fof England, London and South East
OL,10,Funtil Thursday, July 30.
OL,12,FYellow heat health alerts are also in
OL,13,Fplace for the South West, West
OL,14,FMidlands and Yorkshire and The Humber.
OL,16,FITV News explains what drought is and
OL,17,Fwhere in the UK is affected.
OL,19,FWhat is drought?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
