OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency declared a
OL,7,Fflash drought covering half of England
OL,8,Fdue to low rainfall and high
OL,9,Ftemperatures.
OL,11,FThese areas are:
OL,13,FThis has increased the risk of
OL,14,Fwildfires, caused rivers to run low
OL,15,Fand farmers are having to adapt to the
OL,16,Fdry weather by harvesting crops
OL,17,Fearlier.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
