OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785383017
OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,FAlongside seven areas in drought,
OL,7,Fthese areas are now in prolonged dry
OL,8,Fweather: Kent & East Sussex, Cumbria &
OL,9,FLancashire, Greater Manchester,
OL,10,FMerseyside & Cheshire, East Midlands,
OL,11,FLincolnshire & Northamptonshire, The
OL,12,Frest of Solent & the South Downs.
OL,14,FJust Yorkshire and the North East
OL,15,Fremain in normal status, with the
OL,16,Fsituation under close review.
OL,18,FNatural Resources Wales (NRW) have
OL,19,Fdeclared drought status in Gwynedd,
OL,20,FYnys Mon, Clwyd, Dee and Upper Severn
OL,21,Fcatchments.
OL,26,@|D@Gsw
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
