OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785383017
OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,FNRW defines this as a "significant
OL,7,Fperiod of low river flows, reduced
OL,8,Frainfall, declining groundwater levels
OL,9,Fand dry soil conditions".
OL,11,FMany catchments across south-west
OL,12,FWales were also moved from 'Normal' to
OL,13,F'Prolonged Dry Weather' status.
OL,15,FMost catchments in Wales have had less
OL,16,Fthan 20% of their expected July
OL,17,Frainfall, and some extremely dry areas
OL,18,Fhave seen less than 2% of their
OL,19,Faverage rainfall.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
