FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785383017
OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,FIf the hot, dry weather continues,
OL,7,FWales could potentially have its
OL,8,Fdriest July recorded in almost 190
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FThe Scottish Environment Protection
OL,12,FAgency (SEPA) announced five areas
OL,13,Fwith "significant scarcity" of water.
OL,15,FLunan Water, Lower Tweed, Lower Don,
OL,16,FNorth Fife, Fife (East Neuk) have all
OL,17,Fexperienced 31 days or more with river
OL,18,Fwater levels below the threshold.
OL,20,FThe prolonged dry weather is
OL,21,Fthreatening ecosystems.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
