OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland
OL,8,FAlthough the Republic of Ireland saw
OL,9,Fwidespread drought declarations and
OL,10,Fhosepipe bans in July, Northern
OL,11,FIreland has so far avoided formal
OL,12,Fdrought status, and no hosepipe bans
OL,13,Fhave been imposed.
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland Water has however
OL,16,Fwarned that prolonged warm conditions
OL,17,Fare driving increased demand, and
OL,18,Fasked councils and other public bodies
OL,19,Fto reduce or postpone non-essential
OL,20,Fwater-intensive activities.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
