OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,FRecent rainfall, with more forecast,
OL,7,Fhas eased that pressure.
OL,9,FHow does climate change impact drought?
OL,11,FClimate change is influencing rainfall
OL,12,Fpatterns, making some places wetter
OL,13,Fand others drier, as well as causing
OL,14,Fhotter, drier summers.
OL,16,FWarmer temperatures cause water to
OL,17,Fevaporate from soil, making it drier,
OL,18,Fwhich then means the air above heats
OL,19,Fup further and the cycle continues,
OL,20,Fincreasing the risk of drought.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
