OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785383017
OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,FThe National Drought Group, made up of
OL,7,Fthe Met Office, government,
OL,8,Fregulators, water companies, farmers,
OL,9,FCanal & River Trust, anglers and
OL,10,Fconservation experts, held a drought
OL,11,Fbriefing on Tuesday to review the
OL,12,Fimpacts, preparedness and response to
OL,13,Fdrought.
OL,15,FHelen Wakeham, Director of Water at
OL,16,Fthe Environment Agency and Chair of
OL,17,Fthe National Drought Group, said: "The
OL,18,Fhot and dry weather means we are
OL,19,Fcurrently using water faster than
OL,20,Fnature can replenish it.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785383017
OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,F"A second consecutive summer drought
OL,7,Fis an exceptionally serious situation
OL,8,Fand one that will have long-lasting
OL,9,Fimpacts on our environment, wildlife,
OL,10,Fand the economy."
OL,12,FWater Minister, Emma Hardy said
OL,13,Fdroughts are "becoming increasingly
OL,14,Fcommon" and "we need to be prepared
OL,15,Ffor this new normal".
OL,17,FShe said: "We're delivering long-term
OL,18,Fchange in the water industry and
OL,19,Fdriving record investments in
OL,20,Finfrastructure, including nine new
OL,21,Freservoirs.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30813
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785383017
OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,F"We expect water companies to follow
OL,7,Ftheir drought plans, to go further and
OL,8,Ffaster to reduce leaks, and to ensure
OL,9,Fsupplies are not disrupted even in the
OL,10,Fdriest of weather."
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FTo combat the lack of rainfall,
OL,18,Fhosepipe bans have been enforced for
OL,19,F23 million customers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
