PN,30814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785383017
OL,3,CWhat is drought and where in the UK is
OL,4,Caffected?
OL,6,FEven water companies without bans
OL,7,Fencourage households to make efforts
OL,8,Fto conserve water.
OL,10,FWill the dry weather continue?
OL,12,FRainfall is on the way for parts of
OL,13,Fthe northwest, Northern Ireland and
OL,14,FScotland this week, which will be
OL,15,Fwelcome news for farmers.
OL,17,FTemperatures will be slightly cooler,
OL,18,Fbut sunny spells continue,
OL,19,Fparticularly in the south of England
OL,20,Fand Wales.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/14
